    location's planetary body and skips tile layer creation when the saved
    tile provider (e.g. OPM Moon basemap) targets a different body.  This
    prevents GPJ_grass_to_osr() being called for a non-Earth CRS just
    because a Moon tile setting was persisted from a previous session.
