    in a clean event-loop tick, not synchronously inside openMapset(), which
    prevents deep stack interaction with the GRASS setjmp/longjmp machinery.
  * Guard applyMenuScrollLimits() against null QScreen at very early startup.
  * Remove temporary diagnostic breadcrumbs added for crash investigation.

