qtgrass (0.2.7) unstable; urgency=low

  * Scrollable menus: GrassApp::applyMenuScrollLimits() walks every QMenu
    reachable from the menu bar and calls setMaximumHeight(0.70 * screenH).
    Qt automatically inserts its built-in up/down scroll arrow items when the
    menu content exceeds that cap (minimum cap: 400 px).
    Called at the end of buildMenuBar() so Raster (137+ items), Vector, and
    all addon-extended menus are scrollable out of the box.

