qtgrass (0.2.5) unstable; urgency=low

  * Addon menus now integrated directly into existing GRASS submenus instead
    of a generic "Addon Extensions" bucket at the bottom of each main menu.
  * GrassMenuBuilder::build() now populates a PrefixMenuMap that records
    which QMenu hosts each two-level command prefix (e.g. "i.evapo" →
    Evapotranspiration submenu, "i.segment" → Classification submenu,
    "r.stream" → the stream-analysis submenu in Raster, etc.).
