qtgrass (0.2.4) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix addon menus not appearing: $ENV{HOME} was sandboxed by debhelper to a
    wrong path, so grassaddonslist.h was never generated in the deb build.
    Fixed by: (1) debian/rules now passes -DGRASS_ADDONS_DIR=$(REAL_HOME)/...
    using eval+whoami to resolve the real home; (2) CMakeLists.txt also uses
    execute_process(sh -c "eval echo ~$(whoami)") as fallback so cmake -B
    invocations work without explicit -D; (3) menu label matching now strips
    Qt accelerator markers with QRegularExpression before map lookup.

