qtgrass (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial packaging of qtgrass 0.1.0.
  * Complete Qt6 replacement of the GRASS GIS wxPython GUI, implementing
    all 21 planned components:
    - Core framework: startup wizard, map canvas, layer panel, toolbox
    - Map rendering: direct C API and GRASS display-driver modes
    - Module dialog system with GUI section tabs and live output streaming
    - Vector digitizer with QUndoStack, snap support, and topology rebuild
    - Graphical modeler with .gxm load/save and sequential execution
    - Temporal animation with pre-render, STRDS/STVDS support, MP4 export
    - Print composer: PDF/PNG/SVG with map/legend/scalebar/northarrow items
    - Database manager: SQL editor, schema browser, field calculator
    - Supervised classification (iclass) with 2-sigma scatter plots
    - Georectification: dual canvas, GCP table, polynomial RMS, i.rectify
    - Map swipe, WMS browser, network analysis launcher, history browser
    - Temporal plot (tplot) and 3-D terrain view (OpenGL 3.3 heightmap)

